          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 33600,
            "text": "Hey, thanks for jumping on, hope the week is going well."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 48000,
            "end": 52800,
            "text": "Hi, thanks for having us, ready when you are."
          },
          {
            "start": 52801,
            "end": 76800,
            "text": "Hey there, thanks for making time for this."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 81600,
            "end": 86400,
            "text": "Sounds good, I am ready to take notes as we go."
          },
          {
            "start": 86401,
            "end": 96000,
            "text": "Let's start wherever is most useful for you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 105600,
            "end": 129600,
            "text": "Things have been busy but manageable, a few things worth mentioning."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 139200,
            "end": 172800,
            "text": "Let me know what is top of mind and we will work through it."
          },
          {
            "start": 172801,
            "end": 206400,
            "text": "Happy to take these in whatever order makes sense to you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 220800,
            "end": 225600,
            "text": "A posting expires and comes down with no warning to the person who placed it, so postings vanish while they still think it is live."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 235200,
            "end": 264000,
            "text": "We had a posting from one of our members expire on September 5th with zero warning, and they only found out when someone asked why it was gone."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 268800,
            "end": 297600,
            "text": "That helps a lot, I have one clarifying question."
          },
          {
            "start": 297601,
            "end": 302400,
            "text": "Do you know how far in advance a warning would need to go out to be useful for your posters?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 312000,
            "end": 355200,
            "text": "At least a week ahead would give them time to renew it before it drops."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 364800,
            "end": 398400,
            "text": "Good, switching gears, anything else come up recently?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 408000,
            "end": 446400,
            "text": "We are down a person on the finance team right now."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 456000,
            "end": 499200,
            "text": "Good to know, we can point any new folks to our onboarding resources."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 513600,
            "end": 552000,
            "text": "Our executive committee meets in between the full board sessions."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 566400,
            "end": 590400,
            "text": "Nice, sounds like the board is aligned on the new initiative."
